    of the Possessed - Gagigobyte\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF When this card is Special
    Summoned by its effect: You can send 1 random card from your opponent's hand
    to the GY, then each player draws 1 card.\r\n\u25CF If this card is sent from
    the field to the GY: You can add 1 \"Spiritual Water Art\" card or 1 \"Possessed\"
    Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand."
